    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.poster.avif?t=1747542196\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.webm?t=1747542196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.mp4?t=1747542196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Memories of Rachel\u201d is a text adventure game in which you pick up keywords called &quot;fragments&quot; from your memories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you read through the scenario as if it were a visual novel game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story called \u201cMemories\u201d may be disclosed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.poster.avif?t=1747542196\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.webm?t=1747542196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.mp4?t=1747542196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you answer using the key words from &quot;Memories.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secret that the protagonist holds, and the words he must say to Rachel, are revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is just that. No sudden shooting, no map clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the secrets of the protagonist and Rachel, the layered memories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >become thorns that stick in your heart and cannot be pulled out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is Kaori Kashima, a second-year high school student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While she is returning home with her best friend Rachel, Rachel is stabbed to death by a black hooded figure who suddenly appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unintentionally, Kaori Kashima gets hold of a time machine and goes back to her original time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she has indeed been able to go back in time, she finds herself in a slightly different world - a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply going back in time would not have brought her to the parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rachel is alive and moving before her eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, there was a reason why Kaori had to go back to the original world line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where was the point of divergence from the original world, which branched off into a parallel world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She tries to find it in her memories and attempts to travel back in time at the correct junction, but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.poster.avif?t=1747542196\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.webm?t=1747542196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.mp4?t=1747542196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Memories of Rachel\u201d is a text adventure game in which you pick up keywords called &quot;fragments&quot; from your memories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you read through the scenario as if it were a visual novel game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story called \u201cMemories\u201d may be disclosed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.poster.avif?t=1747542196\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.webm?t=1747542196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.mp4?t=1747542196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you answer using the key words from &quot;Memories.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secret that the protagonist holds, and the words he must say to Rachel, are revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is just that. No sudden shooting, no map clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the secrets of the protagonist and Rachel, the layered memories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >become thorns that stick in your heart and cannot be pulled out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is Kaori Kashima, a second-year high school student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While she is returning home with her best friend Rachel, Rachel is stabbed to death by a black hooded figure who suddenly appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unintentionally, Kaori Kashima gets hold of a time machine and goes back to her original time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she has indeed been able to go back in time, she finds herself in a slightly different world - a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply going back in time would not have brought her to the parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rachel is alive and moving before her eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, there was a reason why Kaori had to go back to the original world line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where was the point of divergence from the original world, which branched off into a parallel world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She tries to find it in her memories and attempts to travel back in time at the correct junction, but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Memories of Rachel&quot; is a text adventure where you uncover the past using \u2018fragments\u2019\u2014keywords from your memories. No battles, no maps\u2014only you and the truth. But the secrets you reveal, the moments you shared, will linger like a thorn in your heart, never to fade.",
